{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1709"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/football","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__football.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",312],["+","His fame outlived his playing days. From 1995 to 1998 Pelé served in President Fernando Henrique Cardoso's government as "],["=",2],["+","extraordinary Minister of Sport, and the \"Pelé Law\" he pushed through against corruption in the clubs still bears his name.\n\nBrazil's "],["=",787]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",274],["+","Sein Ruhm überdauerte die aktive Karriere. Von 1995 bis 1998 gehörte Pelé der Regierung von Präsident Fernando Henrique Cardoso als außerordentlicher Sportminister "],["=",2],["+","an, und das „Lei Pelé“, das er gegen die Korruption in den Vereinen durchsetzte, trägt bis heute seinen Namen.\n\nBrasiliens "],["=",737]]}]},
