{"seq":45,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1709"},"reason":"Outdated after the 2026 World Cup: Klose's 16-goal record was passed by Lionel Messi and then Kylian Mbappé (22), and Cristiano Ronaldo scored at a sixth World Cup while Messi reached five. The table row now marks Klose's record as 2014–2026 and the body adds both updates (EN/DE/RU); the 2014 and 2022 facts themselves are unchanged.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/49394546/fifa-world-cup-2026-stats-kylian-mbappe-tops-lionel-messi-22-michael-olise-breaks-pele-record-7-jude-bellingham-7-most-ever-england"},{"url":"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/49140402/lionel-messi-world-cup-record-goals-miroslav-klose-all"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/FIFA_World_Cup_top_goalscorers"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",676],["+","(2014–2026) "],["=",223],["+"," His record stood for twelve years: at the 2026 World Cup Lionel Messi passed it, and Kylian Mbappé finished the tournament as the new record holder with 22 goals."],["=",255],["+","At the 2026 World Cup Ronaldo extended his record to six tournaments, and Messi reached five. "],["=",27]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",616],["+","(2014–2026) "],["=",213],["+"," Sein Rekord hielt zwölf Jahre: Bei der WM 2026 überholte ihn Lionel Messi, und Kylian Mbappé beendete das Turnier mit 22 Toren als neuer Rekordhalter."],["=",243],["+","Bei der WM 2026 baute Ronaldo seinen Rekord auf sechs Turniere aus, Messi kam auf fünf. "],["=",25]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",626],["+","(2014–2026) "],["=",213],["+"," Его рекорд продержался двенадцать лет: на чемпионате мира 2026 года его превзошёл Лионель Месси, а Килиан Мбаппе завершил турнир новым рекордсменом с 22 голами."],["=",221],["+","На чемпионате мира 2026 года Роналду довёл свой рекорд до шести турниров, а Месси — до пяти. "],["=",21]]}],"hash":"5eff0e7bbfe1","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"02cac07c8c2b80a0a00affcbb84c60183e5377594fa4fd0a16aa9c8e7b4e9acb"},
